title: 'statement-store: v2 DHT peer gauge, submissions labelled by retention reason'
doc:
- audience:
  - Node Operator
  - Node Dev
  description: |-
    - New gauge `substrate_sync_statement_v2dht_desired_unconnected_peers`: desired peers with no
      open statement substream.
    - `substrate_sub_statement_store_submitted_statements` is now a `CounterVec` labelled `reason`:
      `dht`, `explicit`, `both`, `transient` (no affinity for the statement's topics), `persistent`
      (no v2 retention resolver).
crates:
- name: sc-statement-store
  bump: minor
- name: sc-network-statement
  bump: minor
